gy and fermion mass hierarchies statistically natural, constrain neutrino masses, and retain these features when the racetrack Kähler uplift model is extended?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0039"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d9b24687086251bbdbfe7df28bfb0a5aa293e9db168052e60418c60f89d6b9f8","title":"Must a gravitational infinite-distance limit that preserves the effective dimension produce a weakly coupled tensionless string?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0046"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d94bc042077bf23276f0043e08fd742b287dbc8e88dfe4e14d57dc201bb568b9","title":"How do expansion, inflaton motion, and a thermal gauge bath exchange energy during inflation?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0047"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d96fa25dcd4732757e6d4968b9151e71819e5af44a621defa85b3c8064cea3dc","title":"Does the Standard Model's no-light-quark limit possess metastable vacua that could trigger a de Sitter-conjecture constraint? At fixed dimensionless couplings, the formal large-v infrared theory contains decoupled pure color and electromagnetic gauge sectors.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0053"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d9899824cc5c7126dc9c234d87d9886ad1cbf6e9e661e689c7a6d0148a851349","title":"Can a properly quantized, primitive G4 flux stabilize all complex structure moduli at a chosen Hodge locus while satisfying M2-tadpole cancellation? Can symmetry simplify F-term equations without leaving unstabilized directions?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0057"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d99a727c0f8ae592c1fc2f6831ca28dab559d4412684ac7084302ae19df08d67","title":"What singularity, perturbation, tidal-response and geodesic properties characterize relativistic singular isothermal spheres, and can their Einstein–dilaton realization connect naked singularities to the swampland distance conjecture?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0069"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d9973d439a43c6548d0a0a2dec74f9e2c82e6ffa4ace64b96e91306f875adaea","title":"Can the positive inflationary plateau of Palatini Higgs inflation satisfy either branch of the refined de Sitter conjecture with positive order-one constants, while remaining compatible with the quoted cosmological constraints and its assumed inflationary regime?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0071"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d92661fc0a8365110c98dd88c75fbf7f5b4c5cdca5bd56b4126b2e7f8ffd8ed7","title":"How does a phenomenological power-law correction modify nonminimally coupled quartic inflation and its potential-derivative constraints?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0071"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d976a4f4113c7bc7bd71e5ef4659adbd1c96f0cb5b833921a2e5ed1329b35254","title":"Can a rotating D3-brane construction embed dark bubble cosmology in type IIB string theory, and can a WGC-motivated departure from critical brane tension produce a small positive four-dimensional cosmological constant?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0078"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d947832ec45cd85d583876c7b9509bb1dc6aa5c6dad5316b37620b4213097cb2","title":"How do quantum CFT4 effects modify gravitational fluctuation spectra and linear stability around Minkowski, de Sitter and anti-de Sitter backgrounds, and which apparent instabilities fall within gravitational EFT?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0081"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:d96db991568cfa4d3ef851704aec50541f5289fc2c8f3cb8e3710e07556b030c